{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>旺角新填地街316至320號一個住宅單位發生火警，據報有充電器短路冒煙。消防接報到場開一喉一煙帽隊灌救，有人報稱受傷。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場射水。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197089642327838720851742.jpeg/5JouYOqF5MF-lb7Tyw7z_Xt5Ok7lEDKGjx_8JI8f_CQ\"/><figcaption>消防員在場射水。</figcaption></figure><p>現場所見，大廈搭有棚架及圍網，消防員向單位射水灌救。一名男子登上救護車接受檢查及治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"一人不適登上救護車接受治理。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197090513149235200312870.jpeg/sU765_yQ5979rWMslXv4pnkLo73oDzZebZnu722Z7u8\"/><figcaption>一人不適登上救護車接受治理。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:49:11.043700+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T23:42:43.835812+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T23:42:43.835812+00:00","content_hash":"02e7d9d2e9ff4d938de1740bb0c6b7a10488c2f8c64b49ce906a65a63194d935","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}